<h1>4612</h1>

<p>A "worlds-building" project and short story series about multiverses.</p>

<p>This series contains some of my earliest works (2020 onwards), which I have revised before posting here.</p>

<h1>:Elevator Pitch</h1>

<p><a href="http://localhost:8080/writing-break/4612/1_hello/">Alec</a> drifts alone in a Void, with no memory of how he got there. In his possession is a strange stone tablet with the symbols <code>4612</code> engraved on its surface. What does it do? How does he get out of here? <a href="http://localhost:8080/writing-break/4612/9_first-contact/">What is that squirming dark shape in the distance?</a></p>

<p>And in his forgotten past is <a href="http://localhost:8080/writing-break/4612/6_siezed/">Atro</a>, a boy on his search to find a new home in a medieval fantasy world with a tinge of sci-fi. How does his adventures leave him stranded in the Void?</p>

<p>Alec finds his way out of the Void, only to realise that this tablet he holds is capable of transporting him (haphazardly) across universes... What will he find in the multitude of worlds, and will he find the one that has his home?</p>

<p>Hooked? Buy now for $9999 (per word)!</p>

